  "details": "It would be incredibly useful for World Creators with worlds that receive a regular update (eg; Games) to have an extra text field separate from the Description specifically for patch notes, so visitors can look from the UI screen and just see, say, \"Oh, there is New Feature\" or, \"That Bug is Fixed\".\n\nThis would also, ideally, be something that can be called as a string value in-world, so you can automatically populate a Patch Notes text field somewhere right from the update in Unity.",
